Subject: [PATCH 0973/3799] soh: rename func_80891AC0 -> BgIceShutter_UpdatePos

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: places world.pos at distance velocity.y from home.pos along the axis given by shape.rot.x and shape.rot.y; called every frame by the opening action.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Ice_Shutter/z_bg_ice_shutter.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Ice_Shutter/z_bg_ice_shutter.c    | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Ice_Shutter/z_bg_ice_shutter.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Ice_Shutter/z_bg_ice_shutter.c
